# Root .dockerignore for the vswap monorepo.
#
# All Dockerfiles in the repo (`packages/agent/Dockerfile`,
# `scripts/test-env/mock-validator/Dockerfile`, and the
# real-validator pair under `scripts/test-env/real-validator/`) use the
# repo root as their build context.
#
# Without this file, `docker build` hands the daemon a tarball of
# everything in the working tree — including each package's
# `node_modules/` populated by host-side `pnpm install`. With pnpm 9 on
# Windows or macOS those nested `node_modules` directories are full of
# absolute symlinks (e.g. `packages/protocol/node_modules/typescript -> /e/...`).
# Baking those into a Linux container leaves dangling symlinks and
# `tsc` cannot be resolved during the in-container build.

# Dependency trees — every container image runs its own `pnpm install`.
**/node_modules

# Build outputs — re-generated inside each Dockerfile's builder stage.
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.vercel

# Local-only state; never useful in an image.
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store

# E2E fixtures and scratch state are bind-mounted at runtime, not baked.
scripts/test-env/fixtures
scripts/test-env/state

# pnpm + npm caches (shouldn't be in the tree, but be defensive).
.pnpm-store
.npm

# Local environment overrides that occasionally leak into the tree.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS junk.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
